# Stage 03 — Global translation research

Read `references/quality_standard.md`, `references/translation_research_universal.md`
(if present), and `references/english_source_notes.md` (if present).

Task: write `qa/benchmark/global_research_ack.md` acknowledging the universal
translation principles you will apply for {{ source_lang }} -> {{ target_lang }}:
register, sentence-flow strategy, punctuation/typography rules, name handling,
and terminology-presentation rules (no source-term parentheses in body text for
ordinary nouns).

Then call `set_state` with status `GLOBAL_RESEARCH_DONE`, step
`03_global_translation_research`.

Exit condition: `qa/benchmark/global_research_ack.md` exists and state is
GLOBAL_RESEARCH_DONE.
